## Migration Strategy

### Phase 1: Add New Types (Non-Breaking)
1. Create `spec-core/src/udaf/ids.rs`, `metadata.rs`, `refs.rs`
2. Keep existing String-based API alongside new types
3. Add conversion methods: `to_typed()`, `from_typed()`

### Phase 2: Dual API (Backward Compatible)
1. Deprecate String-based constructors
2. Add typed constructors alongside old ones
3. Internal storage migrates to typed, but expose both APIs

### Phase 3: Migration
1. Update all internal usage to typed APIs
2. Update CLI commands
3. Update extractors (RustExtractor, etc.)
4. Update graph integration

### Phase 4: Breaking Change
1. Remove deprecated String-based APIs
2. Make all fields use typed IDs directly
3. Release as v0.2.0

